    "finalName": "",
    "description": "An <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Officer\" title=\"Officer\">Officer</a> learns to counter the tactics of their enemies. As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>, you can make a DC 15 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Knowledge_(Tactics)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Knowledge (Tactics)\">Knowledge (Tactics)</a> check. If the check succeeds, opponents in your line of sight lose all competence, insight, and morale bonuses on attack rolls, as well as any dodge bonuses to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>, until the start of your next turn.<br><br>If one or more enemy <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Officer_Candidacy_Training\" title=\"Officer Candidacy Training\">Officers</a> are within your line of sight, the highest level <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Officer\" title=\"Officer\">Officer</a> among them can attempt to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Oppose\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oppose\">Oppose</a> your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Knowledge_(Tactics)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Knowledge (Tactics)\">Knowledge (Tactics)</a> check as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>. If their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skill Check\">Skill Check</a> result is higher than yours, your attempt to Outmaneuver your opponents fails.",
